        "source": "Yoga Sutras 4.17"
      },
      {
        "id": 55,
        "sanskrit": "Sada jnatah chitta-vrittayah tat-prabhoh purushasya apari-nama-tvat",
        "english": "The modifications of the mind are always known to the purusha, because it is unchanging.",
