        "source": "Yoga Sutras 4.18"
      },
      {
        "id": 56,
        "sanskrit": "Na tat svabhasam drishyatvat",
        "english": "The mind is not self-luminous because it is seen.",
        "theme": "Consciousness",
        "source": "Yoga Sutras 4.19"
      },
      {
        "id": 57,
        "sanskrit": "Eka-samaye cha ubhaya-anavadharanam",
        "english": "At one time, both cannot be perceived.",
        "theme": "Consciousness",
        "source": "Yoga Sutras 4.20"
      },
      {
